      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Silas insists the wind carries whispers of a hunger that no mortal can feed, its touch turning steel to soft clay before it even speaks. He refuses to name the corruption, saying it wears the skin of everything until it steals the very shape of a naam. As you approach, he offers only one piece of advice: look not at what you see, but for the silence where the air should be. Follow his words or remain just another lost echo in the dark.",
